	<item>
		<title>Home</title>
		<link>https://j.langschwerts.de/home/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[julian]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://j.langschwerts.de/?page_id=1001</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<!-- wp:paragraph {"fontSize":"large"} -->
<p class="has-large-font-size">I am a data science master's student at the University of Salzburg and a junior researcher at FH Salzburg. My work sits where reinforcement learning meets system identification &#8212; teaching agents to decide which experiment is worth running next.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"24px"} -->
<div style="height:24px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:group {"style":{"border":{"width":"2px","style":"dashed","radius":"10px"},"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"4rem","bottom":"4rem","left":"2rem","right":"2rem"}}},"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group" style="border-style:dashed;border-width:2px;border-radius:10px;padding-top:4rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:4rem;padding-left:2rem"><!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center","style":{"color":{"text":"#767676"}}} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center" style="color:#767676">Photo goes here. Select this box in the editor, delete it, and add an Image block in its place.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"48px"} -->
<div style="height:48px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Research</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>My master's thesis brings reinforcement learning to optimal experiment design for system identification: rather than fixing an excitation signal in advance, an agent learns which measurements will most reduce uncertainty about a system's parameters. I work with the IDA Lab and Simon Hirl&#228;nder, and on the ISIA project at FH Salzburg.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"className":"is-style-outline"} -->
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/research/">Publications and research</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"48px"} -->
<div style="height:48px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Projects</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns"><!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size">CIRCArt</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A browser game about art history. You are shown a masterpiece and have to place it in the correct spot on a timeline &#8212; with bonus points for naming the artist, the title or the exact year.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><a href="/circart/">Play CIRCArt</a> &#183; <a href="/projects/circart/">About the project</a></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size">Handball Tracker</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A match and training tracker for handball teams, running on a Raspberry Pi with a web interface and messaging integration. Currently in development.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><a href="/projects/handball-tracker/">About the project</a></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->
]]></content:encoded>
